html:
{{ print_control(doc) }}
{%- macro v(value) -%}{{ (value or "") | e }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro day(value) -%}{{ frappe.utils.format_date(value) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro money(value) -%}{{ "UGX {:,.0f}".format(value | float) if value else "" }}{%- endmacro -%}
{%- set logo = frappe.db.get_single_value("HRMS Addon Branding", "company_logo") -%}
{%- set employee = frappe.get_doc("Employee", doc.employee) -%}
{%- set signer = frappe.db.get_single_value("Onboarding Settings", "executive_director") -%}
<style>
.lpl-letter { font-family: Cambria, Georgia, serif; font-size: 12.5px; color: #000; line-height: 1.55; }
.lpl-letter p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-letter .addr { font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter h4 { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; margin: 14px 0 10px; }
.lpl-letter .logo { text-align: right; margin: 0 0 18px; }
.lpl-letter ol { margin: 0 0 12px; }
.lpl-letter li { margin: 0 0 4px; }
.lpl-letter .sign-off { margin: 34px 0 0; }
.lpl-letter .signer { display: inline-block; width: 46%; vertical-align: top; }
.lpl-letter .who { font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
.lpl-letter .ack { margin-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px; }
</style>
<div class="lpl-letter">
{%- if doc.processed_by != "Bank" %}
<p><em>The Letter of Undertaking is for a loan from a bank; this one is lent by the {{ v(doc.processed_by or "Company") }}.</em></p>
{%- else %}
{% if logo %}<p class="logo"><img src="{{ logo }}" style="max-height:64px"></p>{% endif %}
<p class="addr">{{ day(doc.accounts_on or doc.posting_date) }}</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="addr">The Branch Manager</p>
<p class="addr">{{ v(doc.bank_name) }}</p>
{% if doc.bank_branch %}<p class="addr">{{ v(doc.bank_branch) }} Branch</p>{% endif %}
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Dear Sir or Madam,</b></p>
<h4>RE: LETTER OF UNDERTAKING FOR {{ v(employee.employee_name) | upper }}, STAFF NO. {{ v(employee.employee_number or employee.name) }}</h4>
<p>We confirm that {{ v(employee.employee_name) }} has been employed by {{ v(doc.company) }} since
{{ day(employee.date_of_joining) }}, and is at present our {{ v(employee.designation) }} in
{{ v(employee.department) }} at the {{ v(employee.branch) }} plant. The employee's monthly pay is
{{ money(doc.gross_pay) }} gross and {{ money(doc.net_pay) }} net.</p>
<p>We understand that you are to lend the employee {{ money(doc.approved_amount or doc.loan_amount) }}, repaid over
{{ doc.instalments or "" }} months at {{ money(doc.monthly_instalment) }} a month, the first instalment falling due on
{{ day(doc.first_repayment) }}. For as long as any of the loan is owed to you, we undertake:</p>
<ol>
<li>to keep paying the employee's net salary into account number {{ v(doc.bank_account_no) }} held with you;</li>
<li>not to pay the salary into any other account without your written consent;</li>
<li>to tell you in writing within seven days if the employee leaves our employment for any reason, and to pay the
employee's final dues into the same account.</li>
</ol>
<p>This undertaking does not make {{ v(doc.company) }} a guarantor of the loan, which remains the employee's own
obligation to you. It ends when you confirm in writing that the loan is repaid in full.</p>
<p>Yours faithfully,</p>
<p>For and on behalf of {{ v(doc.company) }}</p>
<div class="sign-off">
<div class="signer">
<p>&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
<p class="who">HUMAN RESOURCE MANAGER</p>
</div>
<div class="signer">
<p>&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
<p class="who">{{ v(frappe.db.get_value("Employee", signer, "employee_name") if signer else "") | upper }}</p>
<p class="who">EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ack">
<p><b>The employee's consent</b></p>
<p>I, {{ v(employee.employee_name) }}, agree to {{ v(doc.company) }} giving this undertaking, and to my salary and final
dues being paid as it sets out.</p>
<p>Signature &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip; Date &hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;</p>
</div>
{%- endif %}
</div>
